    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207814699999
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something. Order number is VF-881-92B. Can I do it, yes or no?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 34858,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207819833332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let me just pull that up for you. One moment... Okay, I see the order for the Pro-Series cycling shoes. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207825299998
    },
    {
      "text": "They don't work for me. I've adjusted the cleats, I've tried everything. I went for one ride and they gave me horrible blisters on my heels. I just want my money back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 34858,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207837833331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm certainly sorry to hear that, getting blisters is the last thing you want on a ride. Let me check the return eligibility for you. I see the order was delivered about 45 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207849166664
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, I'm busy. Is that a yes or a no on the refund?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 34858,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207861499997
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a yes. Our policy covers returns for up to 90 days, so you're well within the window. I can authorize a full refund for those cycling shoes for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207865166663
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, good. What's the next step?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 34858,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765207876233329
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a pre-paid return shipping label to the email address on file. Just package the shoes, attach the label, and drop them at a post office. As soon as our warehouse receives them, the refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
